        {
          "en": "Several videoconferences were held last week to coordinate the overseas branches.",
          "highlight": [
            "videoconferences"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "上週舉行了幾場視訊會議，以協調海外分公司。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Managers have been videoconferencing with suppliers instead of flying out for meetings.",
          "highlight": [
            "videoconferencing"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "經理們一直透過視訊會議與供應商開會，而不是飛過去當面開會。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "synonyms": [
